  (text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 - JST GH 15P\nSame part and pinout as ControlBoard2027 J14; straight 1:1 cable, 26 AWG.\n1-2 +3V3_HOST, GND on both sides of SCK/MOSI/MISO/CS, 12 HANDSHAKE, 13 DATA_READY, 14 EN, 15 GND.\nControlboard pull-ups/downs: CS pull-up (R73), HANDSHAKE/DATA_READY pull-downs (R75/R76).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §5."
    (at 152.4 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3a1bed32-bc1e-4750-96c5-c97007ca2347")
  )
  (text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2, ESD"
    (at 149.86 104.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5e45a96d-1211-4e9a-a6d6-3abcfbff4e41")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - LINK\nU5, U6 and D4 right at J2 with short GND vias.\nSPI lines over solid GND, length-matched to SCK, as on the controlboard."
    (at 152.4 228.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c6708707-8c94-4f82-9e03-3f24472f2a04")
  )
